  "description": "Kjalvegur, road 35 (the Kjölur route): 111 km through Iceland's interior between Langjökull and Hofsjökull, from about 210 m to 674 m. OpenStreetMap tags most of it as gravel (four-wheel-drive only), with a 15 km paved section at one end. An emergency hut and two viewpoints are mapped within 150 m of the track; services are far apart, so plan fuel and supplies in advance. Conditions change quickly in the highlands, so check local road reports before you go.\n\nRoute data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). OSM ways with ref 35 (19 ways; ids in Nomad sources file).\nCover photo: Hornstrandir1 / CC BY-SA 4.0 / Wikimedia Commons.",
